    - heading: Rebirth
      subHeading: Chapter V
      cutScenes:
      - message: Shared stories and understanding kindle my extinguished fire
      - message: Wings strengthen, lifting my spirit <br> Each small triumph, a new
          feather
      - message: I share lessons learned along the way <br> In hopes it lightens
          the weight others bare
      - message: "I find community awaiting <br> Brothers and sisters who\u2019ve
          walked the same path"
      - message: Together we rise out of the fog <br> Into the next days first light
      levels:
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 83fbc455757a60f4e8518b67be52b284, type: 3}
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: bf3530b1dd3405349abab0ccc5319be3, type: 3}
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 09660d2158204ca47b8514ddc122253b, type: 3}
