    - heading: Setback
      subHeading: Chapter VI
      cutScenes:
      - message: Familiar shadows eclipse the still tenuous light once more
      - message: The darkness descends again <br> Enshrouding any light
      - message: This time, however, I know <br> The shadows shift and pass
      - message: If I consistently trust in this process <br> Reinforcing that trust
          with action
      - message: A new day soon to be born <br> This feeling however will pass
      levels:
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 8b8f87cb47a3f8340b8723ef95af753b, type: 3}
