    - heading: Rebuilding
      subHeading: Chapter VII
      cutScenes:
      - message: By retracing steps already forged, inner light flickers anew
      - message: I reclaim what helped me first <br> Step by step, verse by verse
      - message: Reconnecting to my inner core <br> That flame whose warmth hardly
          exists
      - message: Its ember nurtured, grows <br> With care and time, who knows?
      - message: I reconstruct scaffolds once more <br> This time on sturdier ground
      levels:
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: e08d0497a51ff094e9f869b9ba60b753, type: 3}
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 394c90e2f6e7d1d478cf04b5e35f4586, type: 3}
