    - heading: Resilience
      subHeading: Chapter VIII
      cutScenes:
      - message: United in resilience, we light the changing terrain
      - message: We all walk winding paths filled of fog <br> The fears, worries,
          and self doubt lose their power
      - message: Their words just smoke and mist <br> Behind them waits the new day
      - message: If we but walk to meet its dawn <br> Regardless of how long it takes
      - message: The journey itself transforms <br> It strengthens the traveler
      levels:
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ba038e16b743e554d8528c1258933c77, type: 3}
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: bab64a297fe41dc40a445e93200ceafc, type: 3}
