    - heading: Purpose
      subHeading: Chapter IX
      cutScenes:
      - message: My winding walk enables me to light the way for others
      - message: "In community\u2019s embrace <br> Lifting those still on their journey"
      - message: My scarred up wounds becoming healing words <br> Can help light
          the way
      - message: "One lamp in the windows <br> Show others they aren\u2019t alone"
      - message: We all can brighten the path <br> By sharing our lights
      levels:
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: f05e861da2a067c41b9f237cd4e623f4, type: 3}
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: a10faf6a3994c7c4d8068c20e3e52b38, type: 3}
