    - heading: Clarity
      subHeading: Chapter X
      cutScenes:
      - message: It will pierce the fog, sunrise still glows constant beyond the
          storm
      - message: The storms no longer flood my plains <br> The fog thins, then dissipates
      - message: Outer turmoil mirrored inner chaos <br> With new sight, I see
      - message: Peace awaits within, always <br> Behind the storms, sunlight remains
      - message: However long night lingers <br> Morning eventually comes
      levels:
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: a21fc0e39c61d4941b07b6512a0b2abf, type: 3}
      - levelFile: {fileID: 4900000, guid: 7cf2a86c46bab63479c6e748053ab22c, type: 3}
